      "sort": 200,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {},
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>When a creature that can see the giant starts its turn within 300 feet of it, it's subjected to the following effect. <em>Saving Throw:</em> DC 19 Wisdom. <em>Failure:</em> The target is Charmed by the giant for 10 minutes. While Charmed, the target ignores the Icy Deathlight of other giants. If the target is more than 5 feet from the giant, the target moves on its turn toward the giant by the most direct route, trying to get within 5 feet of the giant. It doesn't avoid Opportunity Attacks; however, before moving into damaging terrain (such as lava or a pit) and whenever it takes damage from a source other than the giant, the target repeats the save. <em>Success:</em> The target is immune to this giant's Icy Deathlight for 24 hours.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
